# Codex: Guide for Translating to English

> **Prefix:** `codex-` | **Type:** Reference Manual | **Scope:** Translation to English (en)

## Conventions

- Imperative mood: "Run the command" not "You should run the command"
- Active voice: "The agent reads" not "The file is read"
- Present tense: "The system validates" not "The system will validate"
- No contractions: "do not" not "don't"

## False Cognates (pt-BR → en)

realize→perform, actually→currently, pretend→intend, resume→summarize, assist→attend/watch, fabric→factory.

## False Cognates (es → en)

sensible→sensitive, actual→current, eventual→possible/occasional.
